oiler":false,"text":"「私がこのテーブルを担当する、柚木しずくと申します。 よろしくお願いします」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7432","sourceWorkId":"21766","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ごく普通の学生。 健気な頑張り屋さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"放課後はメイド喫茶でアルバイトをしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バイト先は英国風を謳った喫茶店で、いかがわしさを感じさせる店ではない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メイド姿は彼女の可憐な部分が強調されている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92996"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9e4faae82b14a1c9e532fc873895f8374153699aca4759cea178d555fbd8fbb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a29e1cfbb27b87cf491fe5f9a8efa654332f64881ae9571dea4f39865d28d166.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"羽月理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s928","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s928","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s928","name":"羽月 理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:29504:92996:5907:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c41980","characterName":"音々・V・コーベット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46457","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"193107"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7419"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41980"},"originalCharacterName":"音々・V・コーベット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"98"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"174"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"97"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"63"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"理事長である岳人の個人秘書。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人の金髪さんとして学内でも知られているが、滅多に学生と会話をすることはない。"},{"spoile